This project is an independent OpenCode adaptation inspired by:

  * dsh-router-laya -- https://github.com/HapyRain/dsh-router-laya (Apache-2.0)
      The four-layer tier-routing design (dictionary intents, judge, regenerate
      escalation, constraint filtering), the seven-question protocol and the
      weighting rules are re-implemented here for the OpenCode plugin API.

  * convaiinnovations/laya -- https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya (Apache-2.0)
  * answerdotai/ModernBERT-large -- https://huggingface.co/answerdotai/ModernBERT-large (Apache-2.0)
      Upstream judge model lineage referenced for context. This repository ships
      no model weights; the heuristic judge is an original deterministic
      implementation.

No upstream source code is vendored; only behavioral design is referenced.
